{"version":1,"content":"<p>Xbox正在測試兩種全新的雲遊戲遊玩方式，其中一種完全無需實體手柄。11月4日，Xbox官方博客Xbox Wire公佈了手機虛擬手柄的預覽功能，該功能將在所有Xbox雲遊戲覆蓋的地區，向適配的智能電視推送。安卓與iOS設備均支持該功能，當「身邊沒有手柄時」，玩家可以用手機替代操作。只需通過二維碼與電視配對，操作界面就會在手機瀏覽器中打開。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1585488.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.605468+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":175,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T12:31:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"22bf3789cb765e3275aae288316b39c683e788badc49670ef5833edd269fb6c4","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}